<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span id="ta_002"></span><b>DIRECTORS,
EXECUTIVE OFFICERS AND CORPORATE GOVERNANCE</b></span></p>

