    for awards approved during 2023 (subject to performance criteria to be established for 2026-2027) but as to which the performance
    criteria (and, accordingly, the accounting grant dates) were not established on or before December 31, 2025. Excludes purchase rights
    accruing under the Employee Stock Purchase Plan.</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td>
