    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Includes
    49,384 shares and 1,651,688 shares subject to vested RSUs held by Hydralex Holdings LLC and 493,015 shares held by Angele Delaware
    Investments LLC (collectively, the &#8220;LLCs&#8221;). The LLCs are owned by trusts for the benefit of Mr. Weil&#8217;s children
